  "prefLabel": "Puc 1602.04 Effective date",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.04 “Effective date” means the date on which the utility is authorized to apply the schedules of rates, charges, and terms and conditions within a tariff or specific tariff pages.\n\nSource. #8428, eff 9-10-05 (from Puc 1601.04); ss by #10535, eff 3-4-14 (from Puc 1602.03); ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24",
